    <string name="guide_title">GST Guide — Simple Knowledge</string>
    <string name="hint_gst">These reports are DRAFTS — verify by uploading on the portal. The app does not file; enter ITC yourself from portal 2B.</string>
    <string name="hint_party">Add customers / suppliers, record udhaar, receive payments. Positive balance = party owes you; negative = you owe the party.</string>
    <string name="hint_payroll">Enter PF / ESI / PT / TDS rates after confirming with your CA — the app assumes no statutory rate (default 0).</string>
    <string name="hint_reports">Tally CSV is BETA — CA pilot pending, not \"CA-ready\". Confirm with your CA before using it.</string>
    <string name="hint_stock">Add items, increase / decrease stock, track batches + expiry. Saving a bill reduces stock automatically for items matched by HSN / name.</string>
    <string name="home_hint">Udhaar stays remembered, GST report gets made — everything free, on your phone.</string>
